# playpick cell: mode=walk boss=crowns spec=paladin:protection style=dodge
# size=25 difficulty=heroic view=1280x800 save=fresh.
# Fresh save only opens Bonegrinder 10-normal by default, so #b=marrow&s=25&h=1
# unlocks the chain up to 25-heroic (any first-boss id works, per direction.md's
# 2026-09-26 driver-lesson note) before backing out to a real RAID -> WALK IN at
# the door, rather than the invite's own "visiting" single-fight framing.
# `boss=crowns` is a coverage label only -- evening steers at no boss, the walk
# starts at the door same as any other -- so it is not aimed at directly.
# First tank spec (paladin:protection) in mode=walk/clear at all, and the first
# `dodge`-style evening: every prior VIGIL crossing/stall on record used
# wander, good, flee, melee or idle, never dodge.
open #b=marrow&s=25&h=1
tap back
tap raid
tap next
tap class:paladin:protection
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot start
evening dodge 200 5
state
shot end
